& 2018 -19 \nhas been received from the Election Commission. The proposal is under consideration of the \nGovernment. \n \n  \n\nANNEXURE-A \n \n \n(a) to (b): Yes, Madam. The ECI has already proposed to replace the pre-2006 EVMs in \na phased manner as under which is under consideration of the Government:- \n \nS. No. Financial year Pre-2006 EVMs which are to be phased out \nBallot Unit (BU) Control unit (CU) \n1. 2015-16 142631 142631 \n2. 2016-17 135481 135481 \n3. 2017-18 190592 190592 \n4. 2018-19 336045 336045 \n5. 2019-20 125681 125681 \n TOTAL 930430 930430 \n \n(c) to (d): The Election Commission has requested to sanction the amount for new \nEVMs to meet the projected expenditure for use in future.  \n \nThe expenditure in procurement of upgraded post -2006 EVMs to phase out the \npre-2006 EVMs purchased from 2000 to 2005, and also for staggered purchse of \nVVPAT units by the year 2018, based on tentative price of Rs. 7867/ -, Rs. 9605/ - and \nRs. 20347/- per Ballot Unit (BU), Control Unit (CU) and VVPAT unit respectively, will \nbe as under:- \n \n \nYEAR ITEM Qty. Tentative \nPrice \nTotal (Rs.) \n2015-16 (i) Ballot Units \n(ii) Control Units \n(iii) VVPAT \n174000 \n174000 \n58500 \n7867 + Taxes \n9605 + Taxes \n20347+ Taxes \n(as applicable) \n1611653288 \n1967704313 \n1399174172 \nTOTAL 497,85,31,773 \n \n \nYEAR ITEM Qty. Tentative \nPrice \nTotal (Rs.) \n2016-17 (i) Ballot Units \n(ii) Control Units \n(iii) VVPAT \n407216 \n252144 \n422250 \n7867 + Taxes \n9605 + Taxes \n20347+ Taxes \n(as applicable) \n3765398416 \n2846206812 \n10100463808 \nTOTAL 1671,20,69,036 \n \n  \n\n \nYEAR ITEM Qty. Tentative \nPrice \nTotal (Rs.) \n2017-18 (i) Ballot Units \n(ii) Control \nUnits \n(iii) VVPAT \n407216 \n252144 \n422250 \n7867 + Taxes \n9605 + Taxes \n20347+ Taxes \n(as applicable) \n3765398416 \n2846206812 \n10100463808 \nTOTAL 1671,20,69,036 \n \n \nYEAR ITEM Qty. Tentative \nPrice \nTotal (Rs.) \n2018-19 (i) Ballot Units \n(ii) Control Units \n(iii) VV