वतंर प्रभार) (श्री संतोष कु मार गंगवार) \nMINISTER OF STATE (INDEPENDENT CHARGE) \nIN THE MINISTRY OF TEXTILES \n(SHRI SANTOSH KUMAR GANGWAR) \n \n(a): The scheme being implemented for welfare and employment of artisans/crafts \nmen engaged in handicrafts sector include Handicraft Artisans Comprehensive Welfare \nScheme, Baba Saheb Ambedkar Hastshilp Vikas Yojana (AHVY) for integrated \ndevelopment of selected craft clusters, Design & Technology Upgradation and Human \nResource Development.  \n \n(b & c): Mid Term and Terminal Evaluation of Schemes are being  conducted regularly to \ndetermine the benefit of the schemes reaching the artisans. Further our field offices \nLocated in various part of the country monitor the schemes regularly.  \n \n(d): The details of fund released under each scheme during each of the las t three years \nand the current year, State-wise is as per statement attached as Annexure -I. \n \n(e): The details of the artisans benefitted under each scheme during each of the last \nthree years and the current year, State-wise is as per statement attached as Annexure –II  \n(f): The Government is implementing following schemes for promotion and \ndevelopment of the handicrafts sector on all India basis. \n  \n1.  A.  Baba Saheb Ambedkar Hastshilp Vikas Yojana,  \ni. Dastkar Shashktikaran Yojana \nii. Design & Technical Up gradation  \niii. Human Resource Development,  \niv. Direct Benefit to Artisans \n\nv. Infrastructure and Technological Development Scheme \n \nB. Mega Cluster \n \n2. Marketing Support & Services \n3. Research and Development  \n  \n\nAnnexure - I(a) \n Referred to the reply to para (E) of Lok Sabha Question 816 to be answered on 3.12.2015 \nSTATE-WISE, SCHEME-WISE FUND RELEASED DURING 2012-13       Rs in lakhs. \n    Ambedkar \nHastshilp \nYojana \n(AHVY) \nDesign and \nTechnological \nUp-gradation  \nHuman \nResource \nDevelopment \n(HRD) \nHandicrafts \nArtisans \nComprehensive \nWelfare \nScheme  \nTotal \nSl.No. State Fin. 